ary and Nov election but decrease as FY22 funded redistricting; Net decrease $8170</span><o:p></o:p></p>  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.75in;mso-add-space:auto;text-indent: -.25in;line-height:90%;mso-list:l25 level1 lfo33'><![if !supportLists]><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Arial'><span style='mso-list:Ignore'>•<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><![endif]><span style='mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"; mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1; mso-font-kerning:12.0pt'>EMA – reviewed accounts basically no change decrease $277</span><o:p></o:p></p>  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.75in;mso-add-space:auto;text-indent: -.25in;line-height:90%;mso-list:l25 level1 lfo33'><![if !supportLists]><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Arial'><span style='mso-list:Ignore'>•<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><![endif]><span style='mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"; mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1; mso-font-kerning:12.0pt'>Contingency – increase overall of $8000 mostly for legal rate increase if additional funds are needed</span><o:p></o:p></p>  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.75in;mso-add-space:auto;text-indent: -.25in;line-height:90%;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo34'><![if !supportLists]><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Arial'><span style='mso-list:Ignore'>•<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><![endif]><span style='mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"; mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1; mso-font-kerning:12.0pt'>Debt service – decrease $9000 no new debt or retirement of bonds in FY23</span><o:p></o:p></p>  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.75in;mso-add-space:auto;