or-fareast'>Finance Director Kenyon explained the following Capital projects:</span><o:p></o:p></p>  <p class=MsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.75in;mso-add-space:auto;text-indent: -.25in;line-height:90%;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo34'><![if !supportLists]><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Arial'><span style='mso-list:Ignore'>•<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><![endif]><span style='mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"; mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1; mso-font-kerning:12.0pt'>Capital transfer – increase $17637 see capital funding next slide</span><o:p></o:p></p>  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.75in;mso-add-space:auto;text-indent: -.25in;line-height:90%;mso-list:l18 level1 lfo35'><![if !supportLists]><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Arial'><span style='mso-list:Ignore'>•<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><![endif]><span style='mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"; mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1; mso-font-kerning:12.0pt'>The need to continue the upkeep of the Town’s infrastructure and Capital assets is essential</span><o:p></o:p></p>  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.75in;mso-add-space:auto;text-indent: -.25in;line-height:90%;mso-list:l18 level1 lfo35'><![if !supportLists]><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Arial'><span style='mso-list:Ignore'>•<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><![endif]><span style='mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"; mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1; mso-font-kerning:12.0pt'>The major capital projects funded with the General Fund Transfer $724,536 consist of:</span><o:p></o:p></p>  <p class=MsoNo